1
00:00:00,978 --> 00:00:02,888
(Howard:)-She nailed it.
-Sounds about right.

2
00:00:03,881 --> 00:00:07,091
(Leonard:)But, you forget,
I did ask you out in real life.

3
00:00:07,318 --> 00:00:09,458
(Amy:)Which couldn't have happened
if you didn't live across the hall from her

4
00:00:09,553 --> 00:00:11,153
(Amy:)which couldn't have
happened without Sheldon.

5
00:00:11,322 --> 00:00:12,662
(Amy:)Same goes with you guys.

6
00:00:12,823 --> 00:00:14,063
(Amy:)If Leonard wasn't with Penny,

7
00:00:14,158 --> 00:00:15,658
(Amy:)she never would have set you up.

8
00:00:15,826 --> 00:00:17,426
(Howard:)Doesn't matter.
Bernadette still would've been working

9
00:00:17,561 --> 00:00:18,731
(Howard:)at The Cheesecake Factory,

10
00:00:18,829 --> 00:00:21,899
(Howard:)and I still would've been
working this beefcake factory.

11
00:00:24,168 --> 00:00:25,648
(Howard:)You would've been all over me.

12
00:00:26,003 --> 00:00:27,173
(Amy:)Well....

13
00:00:30,141 --> 00:00:31,921
(Bernadette:)Hey, Penny, can I take that table?

14
00:00:32,009 --> 00:00:33,009
(Penny:)Sure, why?

15
00:00:33,144 --> 00:00:34,784
(Bernadette:)The one in the turtleneck is cute.

16
00:00:35,279 --> 00:00:38,849
(Raj:)Open wide,
here comes the happy train.

17
00:00:40,851 --> 00:00:44,631
(Howard:)Mm-HM...
Chug-a chug-a, yum, yum.

18
00:00:48,025 --> 00:00:49,805
(Raj:)Hang on.

19
00:00:50,695 --> 00:00:53,195
(Raj:)You got a...
You got a little something.

20
00:00:56,534 --> 00:01:00,024
(Bernadette:)Never mind.

